ic2cextras.guide.title=IC2 Guide
ic2cextras.guide.intro=A field manual for the IC2 Classic Extras machines: steam power, multiblocks and brewing.\n\nClick an entry on the right to open it. Flip pages with the page corners, the arrow keys or the mouse wheel. Right click or Backspace goes back; the arrow at the bottom returns here.\n\nNew here? Start with "Using this Guide".
